{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7dcb73df064f573f4c1d77a8a4923fd2.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7dcb73df064f573f4c1d77a8a4923fd2.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7dcb73df064f573f4c1d77a8a4923fd2.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Year 2046 / Dragon City</strong><br>Neuro-comp interfaces, bionic prosthetics and nano-biotechnology have all become commonplace. Society is highly developed, but the gap between the haves and the have nots has only grown larger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/5d68d6469c1d746ac34cfb287c3a7447.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/5d68d6469c1d746ac34cfb287c3a7447.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/5d68d6469c1d746ac34cfb287c3a7447.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Xiang Zixu, a brilliant private eye, is killed while <u>investigating the disappearance of a famous female journalist</u>. Immediately after his death, he wakes up with a start in his apartment bedroom. Before he can process what happened, his phone rings and his colleague at the agency tells him of a new case: <u>the disappearance of a famous female journalist.</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c132f10bc0034e966f63fc1b2ac43329.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c132f10bc0034e966f63fc1b2ac43329.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c132f10bc0034e966f63fc1b2ac43329.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eye-pleasing Maps and Stages; Cyberpunk-style Eastern Cities</h2><br>This game features 7 finely-crafted large stages, including: Dragon Town, which comes alive with holiday spirit in the evening; the bleak and gloomy Shuigou Village; the luxurious Tang Dynasty Hotel; the maritime Bionic Beings' Training Base; and the Biotech Company...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/3c8bc757be4415e199098fcee5b80f2c.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/3c8bc757be4415e199098fcee5b80f2c.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/3c8bc757be4415e199098fcee5b80f2c.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Developed with the UE4 engine, this game depicts an eastern cityscape with cyberpunk aesthetics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b4339bc669e14b1e7795478919e3265a.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b4339bc669e14b1e7795478919e3265a.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b4339bc669e14b1e7795478919e3265a.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced Battle Action</h2><br>Unlock new weapons and abilities through endless reincarnations to solidify and enhance your fighting skills. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/4eac4e248e5098a6e8cdc9c79e449852.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/4eac4e248e5098a6e8cdc9c79e449852.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/4eac4e248e5098a6e8cdc9c79e449852.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock over 100 weapons, cast skills with prosthetic limb chips, and use tech items to defeat the enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/db61be81a43163139f134c98d9d77b5d.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/db61be81a43163139f134c98d9d77b5d.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/db61be81a43163139f134c98d9d77b5d.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Face over 30 enemies with unique behavior patterns: vicious gangsters, well-equipped mercs, crazy mutants whose neuro-comp interfaces have been hacked, highly trained bionics, etc. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7df278f266420bed50bcd6feec437007.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7df278f266420bed50bcd6feec437007.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7df278f266420bed50bcd6feec437007.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The list goes on, and none of them will be easy to take down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/71a8789743fd1cccf3eb3e2a9f6d2c8f.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/71a8789743fd1cccf3eb3e2a9f6d2c8f.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/71a8789743fd1cccf3eb3e2a9f6d2c8f.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Certain areas will change at random after each life loop. Select your favorite battle mode and investigate the ultimate truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/147fbe9d8d680e3e7a0132fc4c4549af.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/147fbe9d8d680e3e7a0132fc4c4549af.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/147fbe9d8d680e3e7a0132fc4c4549af.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebirth Loop: Real or Fantasy</h2><br>After each death, Xiang Zixu will awaken in his apartment and begin a new loop. As the story progresses, reviewing what seemed like the correct choice in the past may lead to a different conclusion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c9e30aac68dec035c48cf82197606482.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c9e30aac68dec035c48cf82197606482.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c9e30aac68dec035c48cf82197606482.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every decision you make will alter the fates of in-game characters and rewrite your ending.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7f3bb23257e95beae8f20d57e06998d5.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7f3bb23257e95beae8f20d57e06998d5.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7f3bb23257e95beae8f20d57e06998d5.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you ready to initiate a new loop?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b2bb348877383fd97c921668b9ec0085.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b2bb348877383fd97c921668b9ec0085.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b2bb348877383fd97c921668b9ec0085.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pro Gamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/13e3924922fbae60424c031a0ded020851c76c2f.jpg"},{"name":"Targeting the Enemy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/4b4993761828f4ba68aa7fcd227936b0881dd2cf.jpg"},{"name":"Revenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/e2d3c5da56f65a158462e29032220457ec9640e2.jpg"},{"name":"Growth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/406200835ac6f9d8dfde6cef25349c0bb43668e5.jpg"},{"name":"Every little bit counts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/2bc9b1791815d0f7c99650121ad67e05933e6222.jpg"},{"name":"Break no Sweat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/743120fd7cf4bec8209bf36c3a348c5f3878dce7.jpg"},{"name":"Black Cat's Warning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/5320dd4fc0aed0645d2279464d18b55ac4a7278c.jpg"},{"name":"Once Bitten, Twice Shy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/1195b9aa12c45f78c4eb9f01265f77b001c792a9.jpg"},{"name":"Excellent Driving Skills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/730743e0adca0c46599402f59c893b99bc269011.jpg"},{"name":"Greetings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1650810/17226d84a73a791f1a6dd99c47935f2930b44b44.jpg"}],"total":57},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1650810?t=1751566731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1650810?t=1751566731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751566731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751566731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Follow Us</h1><p>For immediate game information, <strong>please add it to your Wishlist and follow us:</strong><br>Discord\uff1a<br>Twitter\uff1a</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7dcb73df064f573f4c1d77a8a4923fd2.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7dcb73df064f573f4c1d77a8a4923fd2.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7dcb73df064f573f4c1d77a8a4923fd2.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Year 2046 / Dragon City</strong><br>Neuro-comp interfaces, bionic prosthetics and nano-biotechnology have all become commonplace. Society is highly developed, but the gap between the haves and the have nots has only grown larger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/5d68d6469c1d746ac34cfb287c3a7447.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/5d68d6469c1d746ac34cfb287c3a7447.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/5d68d6469c1d746ac34cfb287c3a7447.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Xiang Zixu, a brilliant private eye, is killed while <u>investigating the disappearance of a famous female journalist</u>. Immediately after his death, he wakes up with a start in his apartment bedroom. Before he can process what happened, his phone rings and his colleague at the agency tells him of a new case: <u>the disappearance of a famous female journalist.</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c132f10bc0034e966f63fc1b2ac43329.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c132f10bc0034e966f63fc1b2ac43329.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c132f10bc0034e966f63fc1b2ac43329.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eye-pleasing Maps and Stages; Cyberpunk-style Eastern Cities</h2><br>This game features 7 finely-crafted large stages, including: Dragon Town, which comes alive with holiday spirit in the evening; the bleak and gloomy Shuigou Village; the luxurious Tang Dynasty Hotel; the maritime Bionic Beings' Training Base; and the Biotech Company...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/3c8bc757be4415e199098fcee5b80f2c.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/3c8bc757be4415e199098fcee5b80f2c.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/3c8bc757be4415e199098fcee5b80f2c.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Developed with the UE4 engine, this game depicts an eastern cityscape with cyberpunk aesthetics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b4339bc669e14b1e7795478919e3265a.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b4339bc669e14b1e7795478919e3265a.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b4339bc669e14b1e7795478919e3265a.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced Battle Action</h2><br>Unlock new weapons and abilities through endless reincarnations to solidify and enhance your fighting skills. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/4eac4e248e5098a6e8cdc9c79e449852.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/4eac4e248e5098a6e8cdc9c79e449852.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/4eac4e248e5098a6e8cdc9c79e449852.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock over 100 weapons, cast skills with prosthetic limb chips, and use tech items to defeat the enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/db61be81a43163139f134c98d9d77b5d.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/db61be81a43163139f134c98d9d77b5d.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/db61be81a43163139f134c98d9d77b5d.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Face over 30 enemies with unique behavior patterns: vicious gangsters, well-equipped mercs, crazy mutants whose neuro-comp interfaces have been hacked, highly trained bionics, etc. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7df278f266420bed50bcd6feec437007.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7df278f266420bed50bcd6feec437007.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7df278f266420bed50bcd6feec437007.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The list goes on, and none of them will be easy to take down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/71a8789743fd1cccf3eb3e2a9f6d2c8f.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/71a8789743fd1cccf3eb3e2a9f6d2c8f.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/71a8789743fd1cccf3eb3e2a9f6d2c8f.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Certain areas will change at random after each life loop. Select your favorite battle mode and investigate the ultimate truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/147fbe9d8d680e3e7a0132fc4c4549af.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/147fbe9d8d680e3e7a0132fc4c4549af.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/147fbe9d8d680e3e7a0132fc4c4549af.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebirth Loop: Real or Fantasy</h2><br>After each death, Xiang Zixu will awaken in his apartment and begin a new loop. As the story progresses, reviewing what seemed like the correct choice in the past may lead to a different conclusion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c9e30aac68dec035c48cf82197606482.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c9e30aac68dec035c48cf82197606482.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/c9e30aac68dec035c48cf82197606482.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every decision you make will alter the fates of in-game characters and rewrite your ending.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7f3bb23257e95beae8f20d57e06998d5.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7f3bb23257e95beae8f20d57e06998d5.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/7f3bb23257e95beae8f20d57e06998d5.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you ready to initiate a new loop?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b2bb348877383fd97c921668b9ec0085.poster.avif?t=1751566731\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b2bb348877383fd97c921668b9ec0085.webm?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/extras/b2bb348877383fd97c921668b9ec0085.mp4?t=1751566731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["eBrain Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650810/header.jpg?t=1751566731","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256896163,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256896163/movie480.mp4?t=16577281